Package: transmission
Version: @DEB_TRANSMISSION_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: Networking
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://transmissionbt.com/
Depends: libcurl4, libssl3, libpsl5
Description: Transmission BitTorrent daemon and command-line clients
 Transmission is a fast and easy BitTorrent client. This Xios build ships the
 daemon, transmission-cli, transmission-remote, create/edit/show utilities, and
 the generated web UI. The GTK client is omitted until gtkmm is packaged.
